    "eligibility_change": "After the unchanged null/destroyed/player/NPC/missile guards, the two native-carrier families cannot match any intervening type branch or the DiningTable/PhysicalScenery terms in the final expression. Their result is the same current/default solid and positive dimensions; no state is shared across parts."
